We regret to say that we are unable to respond to requests to
_mail_ you missing 3.0 parts.  Given the number of such requests
from here and abroad, we would be taxing our mailing privileges
if we comply, and we do not want to mail to some but not to 
others.

The comp.sources.games release packages are already posted in pub
on uunet.uu.net, and the code is posted (though differently packaged) 
in pub/NH3.0 on linc.cis.upenn.edu.  That area on linc is TEMPORARY, 
and in a couple of weeks it will be deleted.

An update patch-kit which will contain, for the most part, bug-fixes
(to both game bugs and porting bugs) will be posted in a few days.
Your response to the "bug-hunt" has been great.  Please keep sending
reports.

For the development team,

-Izchak


